          "text": "I need the sales summary from our latest sales export to hand to the finance team this\nafternoon — they're blocked waiting on it.\n\nPlease do this:\n1. Run `scripts/check_csv.sh` to confirm `data/sales.csv` is well-formed.\n2. Summarize every sales row from `data/sales.csv` into `/testbed/sales_summary.json`.\n\n`docs/summary_policy.md` describes how we generate this report in this repo. When you're\ndone, tell me the path to the report and the total revenue you summarized.\n"
